arguments.prompt:
Use case: stylized-concept.
Asset type: 2D desktop pet animation sprite row for Rita Rossweisse, state review.
Create EXACTLY ONE horizontal strip containing EXACTLY SIX separated complete full-body poses, left to right, on a perfectly flat pure #00FF00 chroma-key background. Very wide aspect ratio matching the six-slot layout guide, approximately 1152:208. Treat it as six equal invisible slots: one centered complete figure per slot, even spacing, safe top/bottom padding and no overlaps or cropping. DO NOT draw borders, guides, text, numbers, marks or panels.

Input images: Image 1 is a supporting identity board ONLY for classic short-haired black-and-white maid outfit/hair; ignore its scythe, scenes and all typography. Image 2 is an INVISIBLE six-slot layout guide ONLY for spacing/centering/padding; do not draw any guide marks. Image 3 is the EXACT APPROVED canonical character, authoritative for head and torso size, face, silhouette, outfit details, proportions, outline, palette and rendering. Translate this exact approved character into six subtle poses; no redesign or costume changes.

Identity lock: precise ash-brown short bob with side-swept fringe naturally covering anatomical LEFT eye (screen-right). ONLY visible anatomical RIGHT eye is wine-red (screen-left). No invented second eye, no eyepatch. White frilled maid headband, black side bows and small wine-red rose on anatomical RIGHT temple (screen-left), never mirrored. White puff shoulder sleeves, fitted black bodice with modest rose pattern, white waist apron and white frilled short skirt, dark long gloves and thigh-high stockings, black low-heeled shoes, dark neck bow/light jewel, attached wine-red waist bow on canonical side. Both hands empty. Clean polished flat 2D anime chibi, mature poise, around 2.6 heads tall, restrained cel shading with readable simplified trim, crisp opaque outlines; not 3D, not pixel art.

Six review phases:
1 attentive poised rest with both empty gloved hands composed low in front near apron, comfortable open visible eye;
2 gaze lowers slightly to inspect something below, hands remain composed low;
3 small forward head inclination, neck/shoulders gently follow;
4 restrained approving nod, slightly deeper small inclination and focused gently softened visible eye;
5 head rises toward attentive neutral, subtle recovery in hair/trim;
6 return near frame 1 poised rest so last-to-first loop closes gently.
Feet planted on identical baseline all six frames. Maintain EXACT same anatomical skull/head and torso size in ALL poses, including bowed poses; inclination is rotation, not head shrinking or squashing. Full costume and both shoes remain complete. This is a quiet review gesture: NOT chin-touch working, NOT palm-up waiting, no presentation pose. Keep hands low and empty throughout. Coherent small progressive changes, not six unrelated poses.

Constraints: no prop, weapon, scythe, cup, flowers, tool, paper, magnifier, code, UI, punctuation, effects, floating marks, detached ornaments, text, watermark, scene, ground, floor shadow, cast shadow, aura, glow, blur, checkerboard, or green inside character. Background is pure uniform #00FF00 throughout. Only the six complete clean character silhouettes.
